						<td width="100%" class="body" valign="top">
														a Little back ground on myself...<br />
<br />
I am a big fan of sci-fi fantasy books...when it comes to RPG's...this is my first venture...I know doesn't seem like it, but it is...I first starting playing in April of 2001...2 weeks in to it I was invited to my first guild, week after that i was made an Officer...since then OoN is my 4th guild...the other two I was an Officer in...I've never really been considered a newbie, since I have alot of RL friends that paly and were abale to answer my questions ourtside of the game...they also taught me to research before you play...and always have a map on hand (hehe)<br />
<br />
